 fuse stay at the same pixels in all frames."},{"criterion_id":"timing","verdict":"pass","reason":"Timing sheet at 125 ms samples shows the loop F1,F1,F2,F4 repeating; 500 ms loop, F2 flash is the shortest beat. Loop seam F4 to F1 clearly changes (ember to bright plus). Not judged in true playback."},{"criterion_id":"custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"pixel_inspect of F2 earlier showed extent x25-36, y3-13; edge columns 37-39 and rows 0-2 empty."},{"criterion_id":"custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Contact sheet shows 4 distinct frames; distinct_poses=4; F2 body brighter with 3x3 flash spark."},{"criterion_id":"custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Spark has K outline in all frames; earlier preview over yellow brick shows it clearly."},{"criterion_id":"tag:bomb_mark:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Same as custom_1."},{"criterion_id":"tag:bomb_mark:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Same as custom_2."},{"criterion_id":"tag:bomb_mark:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Same as custom_3."}],"warning_resolutions":[],"technical_checks":[{"id":"expected_width","label":"画布宽度","passed":true,"details":{"actual":40,"required":40}},{"id":"expected_height","label":"画布高度","passed":true,"details":{"actual":20,"required":20}},{"id":"expected_frames","label":"动画帧数","passed":true,"details":{"actual":4,"required":4}},{"id":"nonempty","label":"画面不是空白","passed":true,"details":{"blank_frames":[]}},{"id":"palette","label":"色数限制","passed":true,"details":{"opaque_colors":11,"required_maximum":12}},{"id":"tag:bomb_mark:expected_width","label":"tag:bomb_mark · 画布宽度","passed":true,"details":{"actual":40,"required":40}},{"id":"tag:bomb_mark:expected_height","label":"tag:bomb_mark · 画布高度","passed":true,"details":{"actual":20,"required":20}},{"id":"tag:bomb_mark:expected_frames","label":"tag:bomb_mark · 动画帧数","passed":true,"details":{"actual":4,"required":null}},{"id":"tag:bomb_mark:nonempty","label":"tag:bomb_mark · 画面不是空白","passed":true,"details":{"blank_frames":[]}},{"id":"tag:bomb